  tutorialSteps:
  - afterPlayerMoves: 0
    message: Tap an empty tile to place a block. Stop the cat from reaching the edge!
  - afterPlayerMoves: 1
    message: The cat moves one tile after each block. Think ahead and cut off its escape routes.
  - afterPlayerMoves: 3
    message: Keep surrounding the cat until every path to the edge is blocked.
